{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Racing Life \u2013 The Ultimate Motorsport Journey</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Racing Life</i> is a top-down racing game that puts players at the heart of motorsports, offering a rich and progressive experience. From early steps in grassroots categories to mastering the fastest open-wheel cars in the world, every race is a new challenge on the road to glory.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>An Engaging Career Mode</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your racing career from the ground up, starting with classic cars and progressing to the most modern and powerful machines. Compete in championships, secure sponsors, upgrade your team, and prove you have what it takes to become a motorsport legend.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Diverse Categories and Iconic Vehicles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From vintage muscle cars to futuristic prototypes, <i>Racing Life</i> features a wide variety of cars and racing disciplines, including:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Touring Cars</strong> \u2013 Classic and modern sedans battling for every inch on the track.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GT Racing</strong> \u2013 High-performance supercars taking on intense circuits.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Open-Wheel Racing</strong> \u2013 From legendary junior formulas to cutting-edge speed machines.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Prototypes</strong> \u2013 Extreme engineering competing in endurance races.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Tracks and Circuits Around the World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a vast selection of tracks, from tight street circuits to legendary raceways and fictional layouts, each race delivers a unique experience. Master every course and adapt your driving style to secure victory.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Challenging and Strategic Gameplay</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Realistic Progression System</strong> \u2013 Earn money, upgrade your car, sign contracts, and climb the ranks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Competitive AI</strong> \u2013 Face rivals that adapt to your skills for intense challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Balanced Physics</strong> \u2013 A smooth driving experience that captures the thrill of racing.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customization</strong> \u2013 Create your own racing identity with team and vehicle personalization.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Your Racing Legacy Starts Now!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into <i>Racing Life</i> and carve your path in motorsports, overcoming challenges, winning championships, and leaving your mark as a true racing champion!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3610810?t=1763642851","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610810/1de3c866bcfe2af7cea837006f0c4d77c7d45af0/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1763642851","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610810/9313c71ddc882f4d00a4d1823e5f1117b4f4c241/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763642851","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610810/9313c71ddc882f4d00a4d1823e5f1117b4f4c241/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1763642851","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Racing Life \u2013 The Ultimate Motorsport Journey</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Racing Life</i> is a top-down racing game that puts players at the heart of motorsports, offering a rich and progressive experience. From early steps in grassroots categories to mastering the fastest open-wheel cars in the world, every race is a new challenge on the road to glory.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>An Engaging Career Mode</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your racing career from the ground up, starting with classic cars and progressing to the most modern and powerful machines. Compete in championships, secure sponsors, upgrade your team, and prove you have what it takes to become a motorsport legend.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Diverse Categories and Iconic Vehicles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From vintage muscle cars to futuristic prototypes, <i>Racing Life</i> features a wide variety of cars and racing disciplines, including:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Touring Cars</strong> \u2013 Classic and modern sedans battling for every inch on the track.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GT Racing</strong> \u2013 High-performance supercars taking on intense circuits.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Open-Wheel Racing</strong> \u2013 From legendary junior formulas to cutting-edge speed machines.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Prototypes</strong> \u2013 Extreme engineering competing in endurance races.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Tracks and Circuits Around the World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a vast selection of tracks, from tight street circuits to legendary raceways and fictional layouts, each race delivers a unique experience. Master every course and adapt your driving style to secure victory.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Challenging and Strategic Gameplay</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Realistic Progression System</strong> \u2013 Earn money, upgrade your car, sign contracts, and climb the ranks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Competitive AI</strong> \u2013 Face rivals that adapt to your skills for intense challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Balanced Physics</strong> \u2013 A smooth driving experience that captures the thrill of racing.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customization</strong> \u2013 Create your own racing identity with team and vehicle personalization.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Your Racing Legacy Starts Now!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into <i>Racing Life</i> and carve your path in motorsports, overcoming challenges, winning championships, and leaving your mark as a true racing champion!</p>","developers":["Heat Games Ltda"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Racing","id":"9"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610810/94aab5d0308a373bb5516ee843bcdb97f59d781f/header.jpg?t=1763642851","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Steam OS 3.0<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Ryzen 5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 1650<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 8 GB available space</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3610810/1667619888/77e122861937729a3911863290eb2cdf5005ccf8/1757087575/dash_av1.mpd?t=1757090775","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3610810/1667619888/77e122861937729a3911863290eb2cdf5005ccf8/1757087575/dash_h264.mpd?t=1757090775","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3610810/1667619888/77e122861937729a3911863290eb2cdf5005ccf8/1757087575/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1757090775","id":257193736,"name":"Racing Life","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_it